OL,3,GNEWSAShowground arena to hold first
OL,4,Aevent in four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe East of England Showground will
OL,7,Fhost its first event in four years
OL,8,Fafter permissions were granted by its
OL,9,Fleaseholders.
OL,11,FPeterborough-based community interest
OL,12,Forganisation, Up the Garden Bath, will
OL,13,Fhold a Christmas craft market
OL,14,Fcomprising 100 stalls at the Atrium,
OL,15,Fbased inside the showground's arena.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
PN,37802
SC,0002
