PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1794389170
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAShowground arena to hold first
OL,4,Aevent in four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp the Garden Bath co-founder, Kez
OL,7,FHayes Palmer, said: "The East of
OL,8,FEngland Arena has been an important
OL,9,Fpart of Peterborough for so many years.
OL,10,FIt deserves to be busy again, filled
OL,11,Fwith people, activity, laughter and
OL,12,Fopportunity."
OL,14,FKirsty Knight, a Peterborough City
OL,15,Fcouncillor, said seeing the showground
OL,16,Fhost an event after so long was
OL,17,F"absolutely fabulous".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
